Hi,

To follow up to my previous mails, I'd like to propose a project and get
feedback from the list.

I aim to add optional cluster functionality to powertop. The idea is to
allow a user to provide a list of hostnames and see a powertop readout for
all these machines at once in one interface. I'd like to retain the current
powertop interface when this feature is enabled to remain consistent, but
I'd also add a tab containing a sorted list of power guzzling machines.

Overall, I want to facilitate large scale power problem diagnosis.

Comments? Questions?

Thanks,

Ken


